{"id":"t6-tauhid","tahap":"T6","nama":"Tauhid (KAFA)","sk":"Tauhid","ikon":"☝️","warna":"#3E7CB1","bahasa":"ms","kur":"KAFA Tahun 6 (pengukuhan akidah)","semak":"pending ustaz review","jawi":true,"versi":"0.5.68","sumber":"Year 6 tauhid topics (the owner's e-book is pictures only); original notes and questions pending an ustaz's review; shown in full Jawi.","topik":[{"id":"t6-tauhid-1","nama":"Ulang kaji sifat dua puluh","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Sifat dua puluh"},{"j":"l","t":["1. Wujud","2. Qidam","3. Baqa'","4. Mukhalafatuhu lil-hawadith","5. Qiyamuhu binafsihi","6. Wahdaniyyah","7. Qudrah","8. Iradah","9. Ilmu","10. Hayah","11. Sama'","12. Basar","13. Kalam","14. Kaunuhu Qadiran","15. Kaunuhu Muridan","16. Kaunuhu 'Aliman","17. Kaunuhu Hayyan","18. Kaunuhu Sami'an","19. Kaunuhu Basiran","20. Kaunuhu Mutakalliman"]},{"j":"h","t":"Pembahagian"},{"j":"l","t":["Nafsiyyah: 1 (Wujud)","Salbiyyah: 5 (Qidam hingga Wahdaniyyah)","Ma'ani: 7 (Qudrah hingga Kalam)","Ma'nawiyyah: 7 (Kaunuhu Qadiran hingga Kaunuhu Mutakalliman)"]},{"j":"h","t":"Ingat"},{"j":"p","t":"Sifat wajib ada 20, sifat mustahil ada 20 dan sifat harus ada 1. Jumlahnya 41."}],"glosari":[["Sifat dua puluh","Sifat wajib bagi Allah yang wajib diketahui."]]},{"id":"t6-tauhid-2","nama":"Al-Asma' al-Husna","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Pengertian"},{"j":"p","t":"{{Al-Asma' al-Husna}} ialah nama-nama Allah yang baik dan indah. Ada 99 nama yang masyhur."},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">اَلرَّحْمٰنُ</span> Ar-Rahman: Yang Maha Pemurah","<span class=\"arab\">اَلرَّحِيمُ</span> Ar-Rahim: Yang Maha Penyayang","<span class=\"arab\">اَلْمَلِكُ</span> Al-Malik: Yang Maha Merajai","<span class=\"arab\">اَلْقُدُّوسُ</span> Al-Quddus: Yang Maha Suci","<span class=\"arab\">اَلسَّلَامُ</span> As-Salam: Yang Maha Sejahtera","<span class=\"arab\">اَلْخَالِقُ</span> Al-Khaliq: Yang Maha Pencipta","<span class=\"arab\">اَلرَّزَّاقُ</span> Ar-Razzaq: Yang Maha Pemberi Rezeki","<span class=\"arab\">اَلْغَفُورُ</span> Al-Ghafur: Yang Maha Pengampun","<span class=\"arab\">اَلْعَلِيمُ</span> Al-'Alim: Yang Maha Mengetahui","<span class=\"arab\">اَلسَّمِيعُ</span> As-Sami': Yang Maha Mendengar","<span class=\"arab\">اَلْبَصِيرُ</span> Al-Basir: Yang Maha Melihat","<span class=\"arab\">اَلصَّبُورُ</span> As-Sabur: Yang Maha Sabar"]},{"j":"h","t":"Dalil"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَلِلّٰهِ الْأَسْمَاءُ الْحُسْنَى فَادْعُوهُ بِهَا</span> (Surah al-A'raf: 180) — Allah mempunyai nama-nama yang baik, maka berdoalah dengannya."},{"j":"h","t":"Amalan"},{"j":"p","t":"Kita berdoa dengan menyebut nama-nama Allah, seperti <span class=\"arab\">يَا رَزَّاقُ</span> ketika memohon rezeki."}],"glosari":[["Al-Asma' al-Husna","Nama-nama Allah yang baik."],["Masyhur","Terkenal."]]},{"id":"t6-tauhid-3","nama":"Hari akhirat dan syafaat","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Syafaat"},{"j":"p","t":"{{Syafaat}} ialah pertolongan pada hari kiamat dengan izin Allah. Nabi Muhammad SAW memberi syafaat yang terbesar kepada umatnya."},{"j":"h","t":"Yang memberi syafaat"},{"j":"l","t":["Nabi Muhammad SAW","Al-Quran bagi orang yang membacanya","Puasa bagi orang yang berpuasa","Para syuhada dan orang soleh"]},{"j":"h","t":"Telaga al-Kauthar"},{"j":"p","t":"Telaga Nabi Muhammad SAW di akhirat. Airnya lebih putih daripada susu; sesiapa yang meminumnya tidak akan dahaga lagi."},{"j":"h","t":"Cara mendapat syafaat"},{"j":"l","t":["Berselawat ke atas Nabi Muhammad SAW","Membaca al-Quran","Mengikut sunnah"]}],"glosari":[["Syafaat","Pertolongan pada hari kiamat."],["Al-Kauthar","Telaga Nabi Muhammad SAW di akhirat."],["Syuhada","Orang yang mati syahid."]]},{"id":"t6-tauhid-4","nama":"Ahli Sunnah wal Jamaah","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Pengertian"},{"j":"p","t":"{{Ahli Sunnah wal Jamaah}} ialah golongan yang mengikut al-Quran, sunnah Nabi Muhammad SAW dan jalan para sahabat."},{"j":"h","t":"Imam akidah"},{"j":"l","t":["Imam Abu al-Hasan al-Asy'ari","Imam Abu Mansur al-Maturidi"]},{"j":"h","t":"Imam mazhab feqah"},{"j":"l","t":["Imam Abu Hanifah","Imam Malik","Imam Syafi'i (mazhab di Malaysia)","Imam Ahmad bin Hanbal"]},{"j":"h","t":"Ciri-ciri"},{"j":"l","t":["Berpegang kepada al-Quran dan sunnah","Menghormati para sahabat","Bersederhana dan tidak melampau"]}],"glosari":[["Mazhab","Aliran pendapat dalam hukum feqah."],["Sederhana","Tidak melampau."]]},{"id":"t6-tauhid-5","nama":"Menjaga akidah daripada ajaran sesat","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Ciri ajaran sesat"},{"j":"l","t":["Mengaku menjadi nabi atau rasul selepas Nabi Muhammad SAW","Menolak hadis atau al-Quran","Mengatakan solat dan puasa tidak wajib","Mengajar secara rahsia dan meminta wang yang banyak"]},{"j":"h","t":"Cara menjaga akidah"},{"j":"l","t":["Belajar dengan guru yang bertauliah","Bertanya kepada pihak berkuasa agama","Tidak mudah percaya kepada ajaran baharu","Berdoa supaya tetap beriman"]},{"j":"h","t":"Doa"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَا مُقَلِّبَ الْقُلُوبِ ثَبِّتْ قَلْبِي عَلَى دِينِكَ</span>"},{"j":"p","t":"Maksudnya: Wahai Tuhan yang membolak-balikkan hati, tetapkanlah hatiku di atas agama-Mu."}],"glosari":[["Ajaran sesat","Ajaran yang bercanggah dengan Islam."],["Bertauliah","Mempunyai kebenaran mengajar."]]},{"id":"t6-tauhid-6","nama":"Ulang kaji tauhid Tahun 6","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Ringkasan"},{"j":"l","t":["Sifat dua puluh dan pembahagiannya","Al-Asma' al-Husna: 99 nama Allah","Syafaat dan telaga al-Kauthar","Ahli Sunnah wal Jamaah","Menjaga akidah"]}],"glosari":[["Akidah","Kepercayaan dalam Islam."]]}]}